---
title: "cancel (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: onlyProject
    q_auth --> q_check_paused: whenNotPaused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_canceled: whenSaleNotCanceled
    q_check_canceled --> q_check_tokens: whenTokensNotSupplied
    q_check_tokens --> q_cache_capital: capitalToReturn = totalCapitalWithdrawn
    q_cache_capital --> q_mark_canceled: isCanceled = true
    q_mark_canceled --> q_emit: emit SaleCanceled()
    q_emit --> q_check_return: capitalToReturn > 0
    q_check_return --> q_zero_withdrawn: capitalToReturn > 0
    q_check_return --> [*]: capitalToReturn == 0
    q_zero_withdrawn --> q_transfer_back: totalCapitalWithdrawn = 0
    q_transfer_back --> [*]: safeTransferFrom(bidToken, sender, this, capitalToReturn)

    note right of q_check_tokens
        INV-001: cannot cancel after tokens have been supplied
        INV-002: if capital was withdrawn, project must return it
        INV-003: sale can only be canceled once (isCanceled flag)
    end note

    note right of q_transfer_back
        INV-004: project must have approved contract to pull back withdrawn capital
        INV-005: totalCapitalWithdrawn reset to 0 before transfer
    end note
